      "writtenOn": "2025-02-20T14:06:51Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think we can just call this `fInputAttachmentIdx`? It\u0027s possibly used for loading MSAA right now with a special pipeline that doesn\u0027t go through the normal SkSL flow, but it\u0027ll presumably be used for the input attachment-based dst read path.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 73,
        "startChar": 8,
        "endLine": 73,
        "endChar": 41
      },
      "revId": "3639c997a09e5597806ff6be358808a92ab7fd7e",
